This licence covers AITOOL, the AI assistant addon for Cegid PRIMAVERA v10
("the Software"), as distributed by Bola Labs in binary form through the
official installer. It is a freeware licence: the Software is free of charge,
and it is not open source.

1. What you may do

   a. Install and use the Software, for any purpose including commercial use,
      on any number of machines and for any number of users, for as long as
      you wish. There is no fee, no subscription, no per-seat licence and no
      usage metering in the Software.
   b. Redistribute the official installer, unmodified and complete, including
      to your own customers - for example as a Primavera partner deploying it
      for a client. You may not charge for the Software itself; you may charge
      for your own installation, configuration, training or support services.
   c. Configure the Software through its settings, including custom
      instructions, providers and models, and connect it to any AI provider or
      local model you hold the rights to use.

2. What you may not do

   a. Modify, translate, adapt or create derivative works of the Software.
   b. Reverse engineer, decompile or disassemble the Software, except to the
      extent that applicable law expressly permits this despite this clause.
   c. Remove or alter any copyright, trademark or licence notice, or the
      third-party notices that ship with it.
   d. Distribute the Software modified, partially, repackaged, or under another
      name; or sublicense, rent, lease or lend it.
   e. Use the AITOOL or Bola Labs names or logos except to identify the
      unmodified Software - see TRADEMARKS.md.

3. Source code and premium features

   The source code is not part of this licence. Source licences, white-label
   and OEM builds, custom tools and integrations, supported production
   deployments and future premium features are available under separate
   commercial terms - see COMMERCIAL.md. Everything that ships in the
   Community edition under this licence stays free of charge under this
   licence; features released later as premium will be marked as such.

4. Third-party components

   The Software runs inside a PRIMAVERA v10 installation that you must license
   from Cegid separately; no Cegid or SAP binary is distributed with it. The
   installer carries the DevExpress runtime under DevExpress's redistribution
   terms, and the Software embeds open-source components under their own
   licences, listed in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md. Those licences continue to
   apply to those components.

5. Data and network

   The Software sends the data you choose to the AI provider and search
   provider you configure, and only to them, plus the hosts documented in
   docs/SECURITY-AND-PRIVACY.md. Bola Labs operates no server in that path
   and receives no chat content. Optional error telemetry is described in the
   same document. You are responsible for the provider terms and for the data
   protection obligations of your own organisation.

6. Writes to the ERP

   The Software can create and change records in your ERP through the
   PRIMAVERA business objects, after a preview step and with an audit log in
   your database. You remain responsible for reviewing what it proposes, for
   the permissions of the Windows and SQL accounts it runs under, and for any
   record saved through it.

